**WATCH THIS WALKTHROUGH FIRST — before doing anything else, watch the Navigating Notion page below.**
<page url="https://app.notion.com/p/5d7e923a64e28273b34581be41305226">Navigating Notion (Watch First)</page>
<callout icon="👋" color="yellow_bg">
	**Welcome to the team! 👋**<br>Everything you need to operate is in this workspace. Learn it. Your performance depends on it.**<br><br>IMPORTANT LINKS:**<br>- Slack Workspace: [Slack](http://thevaultugc.slack.com)<br>- Payment Links: [Payment Links](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1CNFOPHEPd7ZxHvM87VAzetkTD0mEuvHI7OAKjjoeZ-I/edit?usp=sharing)<br>- Pre Call Assets: [thevaultugc.com/call-booked](http://thevaultugc.com/call-booked)
	**DAILY FORMS (submit every single day you work):**<br>• BOD (start of day, BEFORE your first dial/DM): [Sales Rep BOD form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdpDpmns3tzjeKggQx4BjUedM5UWw2J4KS70nVDJkuQxssI7A/viewform)<br>• Setter EOD: [Setter EOD](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdn9KyQu34k7w_5VeZz9KMTAfPgOLY8KSGytAi1H96L4o9rCw/viewform?usp=header)<br>• DM Setter EOD: [DM Setter EOD form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScGVX1WiFCmv9u60_n4IPPTcaoUEi3b3o4U7AEWqSe0Owxlyw/viewform)<br>• Closer EOD: [Closer EOD](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScnmlqdGzVT7o8X91ENtto620JUnC-nm9j3__dM7wOolL5DlQ/viewform?usp=header)<br>• Post-Call Notes (Closer): [Post-Call Notes](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSewpU5tVRR-r6T2YOseMt8_3m11Yxy_mENsbnqW7K5pD4GxQw/viewform?usp=header)<br>• New Sale (Closer): [New Sale](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeNGwoKueK9fx4YZbjnXrwqDDro9As7BPEdc3Jt2XocOGBzxA/viewform)
</callout>
